Package: cpio
Version: 2.11-r5
Description: GNU cpio is a program to manage archives of files
 GNU cpio is a tool for creating and extracting archives, or copying files
 from one place to another. It handles a number of cpio formats as well as
 reading and writing tar files.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: GPLv3
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: cpio
Homepage: http://www.gnu.org/software/cpio/
Depends: update-alternatives-opkg, libc6 (>= 2.21)
Source: http://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/cpio/cpio-2.11.tar.gz file://statdef.patch file://remove-gets.patch file://fix-memory-overrun.patch file://cpio-CVE-2015-1197.patch
